    "plain": "This policy could shift some fishing work toward smaller UK fleets, but legal barriers under the UK-EU Trade and Cooperation Agreement may prevent parts of it from being implemented, and the electric pulse fishing ban it proposes already exists. Whether it would meaningfully improve pay or jobs for UK fishing workers is unclear.",
    "biggest_unknown": "Whether the TCA permits a supertrawler ban that discriminates against foreign vessels, and if not, whether an equivalent UK-vessel ban would be politically viable \u2014 this determines whether any reallocation of fishing opportunities to local fleets actually occurs.",
