        "evidence_id": "M",
        "quote": "Reform UK will ban foreign supertrawlers from UK waters, extend the ban on pair trawling for bass beyond the South East and 12-mile territorial waters, and ban Dutch vessels from electric pulse fishing in Britain's 200 mile EEZ."
