    "uncertainty": {
      "is_genuine": true,
      "crux_parameter": "Whether TCA obligations prevent a discriminatory ban on foreign supertrawlers, and if so whether a non-discriminatory alternative would be adopted \u2014 determining whether any shift in fishing opportunity to UK small-scale fleets materialises.",
      "estimate_range": "If the ban is legally unblocked and enforced, some modest reallocation to UK smaller fleets is plausible; if TCA constraints bind, the marginal O4 effect is negligible."
